  dialogueLine:
  - Hiya! My skateboard lowkey got taken by the current, it went somewhere to the
    right of us...
  - Would you mind getting it for me? I will pay good.
  - Excellent. I will be waiting.
  - Ah, that's a shame. I am still expecting you to help though.
  - Still waiting on the skateboard.
  - My gratitude to thee!
  - Also, Len over there is very sad, could you help him as well?
